{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/extras/018981fdfca5f5d62476ac348bd488e2.avif?t=1773335921\" width=204 height=93 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Timber Fever</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hired as one of the many disposable beavers tasked with cutting down <strong>Tree of Life</strong> and defeating its <strong>Protectors</strong>. Work nonstop, day and night shifts, to bring the tree down and make your employers some money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don't make it, don't worry. The next one will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/extras/2b81a64ae16ef6d033f2e6b867f00e88.avif?t=1773335921\" width=204 height=114 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your shift and chip down the Tree. Once your shift is over, <strong>buy</strong> <strong>tools\u00a0</strong>that help you cut it faster. Be careful, at <strong>night</strong>\u00a0even more <strong>Protectors</strong>\u00a0will try to defend the Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the Protectors stop you. Find the balance between working and fighting to avoid getting fired.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/extras/4e868759a88ac1ac5eada3de2cebedec.avif?t=1773335921\" width=204 height=117 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 unique tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Seasons with unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute beavers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536160?t=1773335921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536160?t=1773335921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/f05b91c7bca87557101bbb1b267c7c2dbd639a71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773335921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/f05b91c7bca87557101bbb1b267c7c2dbd639a71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773335921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4081680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/extras/018981fdfca5f5d62476ac348bd488e2.avif?t=1773335921\" width=204 height=93 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Timber Fever</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hired as one of the many disposable beavers tasked with cutting down <strong>Tree of Life</strong> and defeating its <strong>Protectors</strong>. Work nonstop, day and night shifts, to bring the tree down and make your employers some money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don't make it, don't worry. The next one will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/extras/2b81a64ae16ef6d033f2e6b867f00e88.avif?t=1773335921\" width=204 height=114 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your shift and chip down the Tree. Once your shift is over, <strong>buy</strong> <strong>tools\u00a0</strong>that